message: "If you use this software, please cite the associated paper."
title: "VesEvoL — Vesicle Evolution over Long time"
abstract: >
  Image-analysis framework for detecting a large mother vesicle boundary in
  time-lapse microscopy stacks, detecting and locally tracking smaller daughter
  vesicles, quantifying vesicle geometry and contacts over extended time
  periods, and supporting downstream analysis and figure generation.
